63537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "For hundreds of years, the only tree that was more popular in Britain than elm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3921482016175235, "w": 0.8073789362277358, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was 24 ............ . Starting in the Bronze Age, many tools were made from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4204785516916611, "w": 0.8073743226048146, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "elm and people also used it to make weapons. In the 18th century, it was grown", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44880890176579874, "w": 0.8068107429337495, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to provide wood for boxes and 25 ............ . Due to its strength, elm was", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4771639970734235, "w": 0.8073702216066624, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "often used for mining equipment and the Cutty Sark's 26 ............ was", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5054943848689536, "w": 0.8076624177250061, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "also constructed from elm.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5338247349430912, "w": 0.2778594389034833, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}